,"sponsorshipDate":"2025-05-29","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MD"},{"bioguideId":"D000617","fullName":"Rep. DelBene, Suzan K. [D-WA-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-06-03","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WA"},{"bioguideId":"M001223","fullName":"Rep. Magaziner, Seth [D-RI-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-07-17","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"RI"},{"bioguideId":"V000138","fullName":"Rep. Vindman, Eugene Simon [D-VA-7]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-08-29","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"VA"},{"bioguideId":"G000602","fullName":"Rep. Gillen, Laura [D-NY-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-07","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NY"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T20:33:23+00:00","id":"hr2294-119","introducedDate":"2025-03-24","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-03-17","text":"Received in the Senate and Read twice and referred to the Committee on Commerce, Science, and Transportation."},"laws":[],"number":"2294","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Public Lands and Natural Resources","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"E000235","district":4,"fullName":"Rep. Ezell, Mike [R-MS-4]","party":"R","state":"MS"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2026-02-09","actionDesc":"Reported to House","text":"<p>This bill reauthorizes and modifies the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration's&nbsp;Integrated Ocean Observation System (IOOS).&nbsp;(The IOOS is made up of radar, gliders, buoys, vessels, and different models and forecasts that collect data points to monitor and report on conditions along the nation's coasts and in marine waters.)</p><p>Specifically, the bill reauthorizes the IOOS through FY2030. The bill also&nbsp;directs the Interagency Ocean Observation Committee (which coordinates interagency planning, budgeting, and assessments for the system) to develop requirements and processes&nbsp;for regional offices and federally funded projects of the agencies of the committee to collaborate with the regional coastal observing systems for data sharing at regional levels.&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2026-03-16T10:52:50Z","versionCode":"07"}],"title":"To reauthorize the Integrated Coastal and Ocean Observation System Act of 2009.","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-08T18:03:40Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-08T18:03:40Z"}
